@startuml sequence-items
title シーケンス: Items一覧取得 (MSW)

participant TabItemsPage
participant "useItems" as Comp
participant "listItems() (api/items)" as API
participant "MSW /items" as MSW

TabItemsPage -> Comp : onMounted → load()
Comp -> Comp : loading = true
Comp -> API : listItems()
API -> MSW : GET /api/items
MSW --> API : Item[] (Coffee/Sandwich/Notebook)
alt 成功
  API --> Comp : items
  Comp -> Comp : items = [...]; loading=false
  Comp --> TabItemsPage : items-list 表示
else 失敗
  API --> Comp : throw
  Comp -> Comp : error = e; loading=false
  Comp --> TabItemsPage : items-error 表示
end
note right of TabItemsPage
  0件なら items-empty。
  各行は ItemListItem、@select で /items/:id へ。
end note
@enduml
